lines = Array[String](["Pleased to meet you, Cupid. I am Nasim Cranter, heir of Crathod.", "I simply cannot wait to meet the heir of Philsopoll, Izzy! While our fields differ, I am sure we can learn much from each other!", "Due to her passion, I recall tales of them forgetting its bodily needs. I hazard a guess that the pastries for our meeting might need more intricacy for him to be intirgued enough take a bite.", "Well wishes to you and Izzy!"])
